sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant CO as Coordinator Node
    participant R1 as Replica Node 1
    participant R2 as Replica Node 2
    participant R3 as Replica Node 3
    participant CL as Commit Log
    participant MT as MemTable
    participant SS as SSTable

    C->>CO: INSERT order_123
    
    Note over CO: Hash partition key<br/>Identify 3 replicas
    
    par Parallel write to replicas
        CO->>R1: Forward write
        R1->>CL: Append (durability)
        R1->>MT: Write to memory
        R1-->>CO: ACK
    and
        CO->>R2: Forward write
        R2->>CL: Append
        R2->>MT: Write
        R2-->>CO: ACK
    and
        CO->>R3: Forward write
        R3->>CL: Append
        R3->>MT: Write
        R3-->>CO: ACK
    end
    
    Note over CO: Wait for consistency level<br/>QUORUM = 2 of 3
    
    CO-->>C: SUCCESS
    
    Note over MT,SS: Background async
    MT->>SS: Flush when MemTable full
    Note over SS: SSTable is immutable<br/>Compaction merges later
